# The fully isolated demo app (demo/ at the repo root, a completely
# separate Vite project — see app/build-with-demo.sh) is merged into this
# same static site's own dist/demo/ at build time. These two rules have to
# come before the catch-all SPA-fallback rule below (rules are matched
# top-to-bottom, first match wins), or every /demo/* request would
# already be swallowed by the app's own index.html instead.
/demo /demo/index.html 200
/demo/* /demo/index.html 200
/* /index.html 200
